WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.425
When a ticket seems missing, check whether you are in My Tickets or the department queue.

00:00:05.425 --> 00:00:11.875
Move to All Tickets, clear filters and search for the exact number before assuming the record was lost.

00:00:11.875 --> 00:00:18.275
Open the match and verify the title; a different queue changes what you see, not the underlying repair.
